  lines:
  - speakerName: ???
    portrait: {fileID: -6330137130904030180, guid: 57fc9b59f68af8b43b8f7a7cf2867cfa, type: 3}
    text: "JAJAJAJA... oye, Miguel, me extra\xF1aste?"
  - speakerName: Miguel
    portrait: {fileID: 3305584300917870274, guid: a6869cb4915bd344eac43cb7806023d2, type: 3}
    text: Otra vez tu?!, es que estas en todas partes??!!
  - speakerName: ???
    portrait: {fileID: 5671780370391936197, guid: 57fc9b59f68af8b43b8f7a7cf2867cfa, type: 3}
    text: Deja de escapar de mi, no te volvere a perder...
  - speakerName: Miguel
    portrait: {fileID: 6823381380481023060, guid: a6869cb4915bd344eac43cb7806023d2, type: 3}
    text: Oye, jugador, creo que deberias esconderte y correr o nos mataran jajaja.
  - speakerName: Miguel
    portrait: {fileID: 3305584300917870274, guid: a6869cb4915bd344eac43cb7806023d2, type: 3}
    text: Ahi viene!!!
